# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development. `.dev.vars` is git-ignored.
# Wrangler loads this file automatically when running `npm run preview`.
#
# Optional. A GitHub personal access token with NO scopes ("public repositories,
# read-only" is enough) raises the blog's GitHub API rate limit from 60 to 5,000
# requests per hour. The site works without it.
#
# In production this is set with `npx wrangler secret put GITHUB_TOKEN`.
GITHUB_TOKEN=""
